  "sourceFacts": {
    "horizontalBasis": "Retained exact-QID relation1841089/Q338397 correlates standard PMTiles parent52776559974337 and its dome35184503447773/lantern35184503447753. Parent23.3x17.7m outline and two front holes establish the occupied envelope/curved entrance. Anchor12.487210858,41.891868949; heading0; internal cross-axis+.419392559901rad, portal faces southwest/local+z. Roof/lantern center aboutlocal[0,-1.9]; footprint controls extent, ordinary high-front and portal photographs establish facing/features. Church52776559959379 and other independent map inputs are preserved.",
    "architecturalHeights": "Picture/map visualization estimates: body radius7.2m and eave11.4m above local floor, three shallow tiled roof steps ending14.6m; lantern radius1.85m/height2.5m, metal dome1.65m and finial0.25m, top about19m above floor. Nominal mapped dome height24m is retained as a source fact, not a surveyed threshold-relative height; profile follows photographed proportions against the27m mapped church. Portal opening2.85x4.8m, outer entablature5.3x6.2m, purple columns5.1m. Right columns about7.5/6.2m, left stumps0.8/1.7m; positions/inventory/capital/carving/repair details approximate. Closed door follows inspected2005 detail;2008 whole photo shows an open state."
